DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260815T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260815T153000
UID:69ff79afe8af4a2f00715149@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The Field of Dreamers Cooperative Softball Association\, led b
 y author and scholar CeCe Fortier\, will facilitate an open discussion on 
 the politics of anti-fascism exhibited in the 1933 Christie Pits Riots.\nT
 hey will also discuss sports leagues as spaces for inclusive community org
 anizing\, drawing on their experiences in Black and abolitionist\, Jewish 
 anti-fascist\, and trans organizing.\nNo registration required. Drop-in sp
 ace will be available until room capacity is reached.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 101
